  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A basic economic development recovery programme to bring economic opportunity and long-term stability to Somaliland. This programme contributes to the SDGs by rehabilitating basic economic assets, improving government capability to manage them, and supporting livelihoods in one of the hardest and most complex environments.</narrative>
